"Use the <a href=\"https://github.com/xr58ya/grid-central-support/issues/new?template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-support-form=\"bug\">bug report form</a> on GitHub (it fills in your version; issues there are public, so leave out anything private), or email <a href=\"mailto:support.gridcentral@gmail.com?subject=Grid%20Central%3A%20problem%20report&amp;body=Version%20(bottom%20of%20the%20app)%3A%20%0ATrack%3A%20%0ACar%3A%20%0AWhat%20happened%3A%20%0A%0APlease%20attach%20companion.log%20from%20the%20Grid%20Central%20folder.\">support.gridcentral@gmail.com</a> with the track, the car and what you were doing, and attach companion.log (see above). After your first session, the iracing-variables.txt file next to GridCentral.exe helps too.": "Nutz das <a href=\"https://github.com/xr58ya/grid-central-support/issues/new?template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-support-form=\"bug\">Fehlerbericht-Formular</a> auf GitHub (es trägt deine Version ein; Meldungen dort sind öffentlich, also lass Privates weg), oder schreib an <a href=\"mailto:support.gridcentral@gmail.com?subject=Grid%20Central%3A%20problem%20report&amp;body=Version%20(bottom%20of%20the%20app)%3A%20%0ATrack%3A%20%0ACar%3A%20%0AWhat%20happened%3A%20%0A%0APlease%20attach%20companion.log%20from%20the%20Grid%20Central%20folder.\">support.gridcentral@gmail.com</a> mit der Strecke, dem Auto und was du gerade gemacht hast, und häng companion.log an (siehe oben). Nach deiner ersten Session hilft auch die Datei iracing-variables.txt neben GridCentral.exe.",
